---
// No need for currentYear in this standalone homepage
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>Kettlebird Creations • Writer & Illustrator</title>
    <meta name="description" content="Portfolio of Star Goldberg (they/them) - UPA-inspired illustrations, comics, and written works featuring fantasy characters and fanart." />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
    <link
      href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Caveat:wght@600;700&family=DM+Sans:wght@400;500;700&family=Patrick+Hand:wght@400&display=swap"
      rel="stylesheet"
    />
    <style>
      :root {
        --color-beige: #f5f1e8;
        --color-yellow: #F4CE6A;
        --color-orange: #E89A5A;
        --color-green: #A8D5BA;
        --color-dark-purple: #4A4063;
        --color-ink: #2b2b2b;
      }

      * {
        box-sizing: border-box;
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
      }

      body {
        font-family: 'DM Sans', system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;
        background-color: var(--color-beige);
        color: var(--color-ink);
        line-height: 1.6;
        background-image:
          repeating-linear-gradient(0deg, transparent, transparent 2px, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.03) 2px, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.03) 4px),
          repeating-linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, transparent 2px, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.03) 2px, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.03) 4px);
        background-size: 400px 400px, 400px 400px;
      }

      .homepage {
        max-width: 1200px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        padding: 2rem 1rem;
      }

      /* Header */
      .homepage-header {
        margin-bottom: 2rem;
      }

      .homepage-title {
        font-family: 'Caveat', cursive;
        font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 4rem);
        font-weight: 700;
        margin: 0;
        letter-spacing: 0.02em;
      }

      .subtitle-nav-container {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 1rem;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
      }

      .homepage-subtitle {
        font-family: 'Caveat', cursive;
        font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 4vw, 2.5rem);
        font-weight: 600;
        margin: 0;
      }

      /* Navigation */
      .homepage-nav {
        display: flex;
        gap: 0.5rem;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
      }

      .nav-button {
        font-family: 'Patrick Hand', sans-serif;
        font-size: 1rem;
        padding: 0.5rem 1.25rem;
        border: 2px solid var(--color-ink);
        background: var(--color-yellow);
        color: var(--color-ink);
        text-decoration: none;
        display: inline-block;
        font-weight: 600;
        transition: all 0.2s;
      }

      .nav-button:hover {
        transform: translate(-2px, -2px);
        box-shadow: 4px 4px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
      }

      .nav-button.nav-button-highlight {
        background: var(--color-ink);
        color: white;
      }

      /* Main Grid */
      .grid-container {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(6, 1fr);
        grid-template-rows: repeat(7, minmax(75px, auto));
        gap: 1rem;
        margin-bottom: 2rem;
      }

      .grid-tile {
        border: 3px solid var(--color-ink);
        overflow: hidden;
        position: relative;
        min-height: 75px;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        text-decoration: none;
        transition: transform 0.2s;
      }

      .grid-tile:hover {
        transform: translate(-2px, -2px);
        box-shadow: 6px 6px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15);
      }

      .grid-tile-portfolio {
        grid-column: span 2;
        grid-row: span 2;
        background: #8B7355;
      }

      .grid-tile-logo {
        grid-column: span 2;
        grid-row: span 4;
        background: var(--color-yellow);
      }

      .grid-tile-merch {
        grid-column: span 2;
        grid-row: span 2;
        background: var(--color-orange);
      }

      .grid-tile-comics {
        grid-column: span 2;
        grid-row: span 3;
        background: #C8C8C8;
      }

      .grid-tile-commissions {
        grid-column: span 2;
        grid-row: span 2;
        background: #A8A8A8;
      }

      .grid-tile-writing {
        grid-column: 1 / span 2;
        grid-row: 6 / span 2;
        background: #D94F3D;
      }

      .grid-tile-contact {
        grid-column: 3 / span 2;
        grid-row: 5 / span 3;
        background: #CC5544;
      }

      .grid-tile-about {
        grid-column: 5 / span 1;
        grid-row: 5 / span 3;
        background: var(--color-green);
      }

      .grid-tile-about .tile-content {
        justify-content: flex-start;
      }

      .grid-tile-news {
        grid-column: 6 / span 1;
        grid-row: 5 / span 3;
        background: var(--color-yellow);
      }

      .grid-tile-news .tile-content {
        justify-content: flex-end;
      }

      .tile-content {
        text-align: center;
        padding: 1rem;
        width: 100%;
        height: 100%;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
      }

      .tile-title {
        font-family: 'Caveat', cursive;
        font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2.5rem);
        font-weight: 700;
        color: white;
        text-shadow: 2px 2px 4px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
      }

      .tile-image {
        width: 100%;
        height: 100%;
        object-fit: cover;
      }

      /* Add subtle texture/pattern to tiles */
      .grid-tile-portfolio {
        background-image: 
          linear-gradient(rgba(139, 115, 85, 0.9), rgba(139, 115, 85, 0.9)),
          url("data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg width='60' height='60' viewBox='0 0 60 60' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%3E%3Cg fill='none' fill-rule='evenodd'%3E%3Cg fill='%23000000' fill-opacity='0.1'%3E%3Cpath d='M36 34v-4h-2v4h-4v2h4v4h2v-4h4v-2h-4zm0-30V0h-2v4h-4v2h4v4h2V6h4V4h-4zM6 34v-4H4v4H0v2h4v4h2v-4h4v-2H6zM6 4V0H4v4H0v2h4v4h2V6h4V4H6z'/%3E%3C/g%3E%3C/g%3E%3C/svg%3E");
      }

      .grid-tile-comics {
        background-image: 
          linear-gradient(rgba(200, 200, 200, 0.9), rgba(200, 200, 200, 0.9)),
          url("data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg width='40' height='40' viewBox='0 0 40 40' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%3E%3Cg fill='%23000000' fill-opacity='0.1' fill-rule='evenodd'%3E%3Cpath d='M0 40L40 0H20L0 20M40 40V20L20 40'/%3E%3C/g%3E%3C/svg%3E");
      }

      .grid-tile-writing {
        background-image: 
          linear-gradient(rgba(217, 79, 61, 0.9), rgba(217, 79, 61, 0.9)),
          url("data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg width='20' height='20' viewBox='0 0 20 20' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%3E%3Cg fill='%23000000' fill-opacity='0.15' fill-rule='evenodd'%3E%3Ccircle cx='3' cy='3' r='3'/%3E%3Ccircle cx='13' cy='13' r='3'/%3E%3C/g%3E%3C/svg%3E");
      }

      .grid-tile-commissions {
        background-image: 
          linear-gradient(rgba(168, 168, 168, 0.9), rgba(168, 168, 168, 0.9)),
          url("data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg width='60' height='60' viewBox='0 0 60 60' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%3E%3Cg fill='none' fill-rule='evenodd'%3E%3Cg fill='%23000000' fill-opacity='0.1'%3E%3Cpath d='M36 34v-4h-2v4h-4v2h4v4h2v-4h4v-2h-4zm0-30V0h-2v4h-4v2h4v4h2V6h4V4h-4zM6 34v-4H4v4H0v2h4v4h2v-4h4v-2H6zM6 4V0H4v4H0v2h4v4h2V6h4V4H6z'/%3E%3C/g%3E%3C/g%3E%3C/svg%3E");
      }

      .grid-tile-contact {
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #CC5544 0%, #D94F3D 100%);
      }

      .logo-content {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        width: 100%;
        height: 100%;
      }

      .logo-shape {
        width: clamp(150px, 50%, 250px);
        height: clamp(180px, 60%, 300px);
        background: var(--color-dark-purple);
        border-radius: 50% 50% 0 50%;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        margin-bottom: 1rem;
        position: relative;
      }

      .logo-inner {
        width: 35%;
        height: 25%;
        background: var(--color-beige);
        border-radius: 50%;
        position: absolute;
        top: 30%;
        left: 50%;
        transform: translateX(-50%);
      }

      .logo-letters {
        font-family: 'Caveat', cursive;
        font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 4rem);
        font-weight: 700;
        color: var(--color-ink);
      }

      /* Social Links */
      .social-links {
        display: flex;
        gap: 0.5rem;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        justify-content: center;
        margin-bottom: 3rem;
      }

      .social-link {
        font-family: 'Patrick Hand', sans-serif;
        font-size: 1rem;
        padding: 0.5rem 1rem;
        border: 2px solid var(--color-ink);
        text-decoration: none;
        color: var(--color-ink);
        font-weight: 600;
        transition: all 0.2s;
        display: inline-block;
      }

      .social-link:nth-child(1) { background: var(--color-green); }
      .social-link:nth-child(2) { background: var(--color-yellow); }
      .social-link:nth-child(3) { background: var(--color-orange); }
      .social-link:nth-child(4) { background: #E89ACF; }

      .social-link:hover {
        transform: translate(-2px, -2px);
        box-shadow: 4px 4px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
      }

      /* About Section */
      .about-section {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 1fr 2fr;
        gap: 2rem;
        margin-bottom: 2rem;
        align-items: start;
      }

      .about-section h2 {
        font-family: 'Caveat', cursive;
        font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3rem);
        font-weight: 700;
        margin-bottom: 1rem;
        grid-column: 1 / -1;
      }

      .portrait-placeholder {
        background: var(--color-yellow);
        border: 3px solid var(--color-ink);
        aspect-ratio: 3/4;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        font-family: 'Patrick Hand', sans-serif;
        font-size: 1.2rem;
        text-align: center;
        padding: 2rem;
        box-shadow: 4px 4px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
      }

      .about-text {
        font-size: 1rem;
        line-height: 1.8;
        color: var(--color-ink);
      }

      /* Responsive */
      @media (max-width: 768px) {
        .subtitle-nav-container {
          flex-direction: column;
          align-items: flex-start;
        }

        .grid-container {
          grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
        }

        .grid-tile-portfolio,
        .grid-tile-logo,
        .grid-tile-merch,
        .grid-tile-comics,
        .grid-tile-commissions,
        .grid-tile-writing,
        .grid-tile-contact {
          grid-column: span 2;
          grid-row: auto;
        }

        .grid-tile-about,
        .grid-tile-news {
          grid-column: span 1;
          grid-row: auto;
        }

        /* Mobile panel ordering */
        .grid-tile-logo { order: -1; }      /* 1st - Logo/Hero */
        .grid-tile-portfolio { order: 0; }  /* 2nd - Portfolio */
        .grid-tile-comics { order: 1; }     /* 3rd - Comics */
        .grid-tile-writing { order: 2; }    /* 4th - Writing */
        .grid-tile-commissions { order: 3; }/* 5th - Commissions */
        .grid-tile-merch { order: 4; }      /* 6th - Merch */
        .grid-tile-about { order: 5; }      /* 7th - About (left) */
        .grid-tile-news { order: 6; }       /* 7th - News (right) */
        .grid-tile-contact { order: 7; }    /* 8th - Contact */

        .about-section {
          grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        }

        .portrait-placeholder {
          max-width: 300px;
          margin: 0 auto;
        }
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="homepage">
      <!-- Header -->
      <header class="homepage-header">
        <h1 class="homepage-title">Kettlebird</h1>
        <div class="subtitle-nav-container">
          <p class="homepage-subtitle">Comics + Illustration</p>
          <!-- Navigation -->
          <nav class="homepage-nav">
            <a href="/portfolio" class="nav-button">PORTFOLIO</a>
            <a href="/comics" class="nav-button">COMICS</a>
            <a href="/writing" class="nav-button">WRITING</a>
            <a href="/about" class="nav-button">ABOUT</a>
            <a href="#news" class="nav-button nav-button-highlight">NEWS</a>
          </nav>
        </div>
      </header>

      <!-- Main Grid -->
      <div class="grid-container">
        <!-- Portfolio Tile -->
        <a href="/portfolio" class="grid-tile grid-tile-portfolio">
          <div class="tile-content">
            <span class="tile-title">PORTFOLIO</span>
          </div>
        </a>

        <!-- Logo Tile -->
        <div class="grid-tile grid-tile-logo">
          <img src="/assets/images/kblogo.png" alt="Kettlebird Logo" class="tile-image" width="1600" height="1600" />
        </div>

        <!-- Merch Tile -->
        <a href="/shop" class="grid-tile grid-tile-merch">
          <div class="tile-content">
            <span class="tile-title">MERCH</span>
          </div>
        </a>

        <!-- Comics Tile -->
        <a href="/comics" class="grid-tile grid-tile-comics">
          <div class="tile-content">
            <span class="tile-title">COMICS</span>
          </div>
        </a>

        <!-- Commissions Tile -->
        <a href="/commissions" class="grid-tile grid-tile-commissions">
          <div class="tile-content">
            <span class="tile-title">COMMISSIONS</span>
          </div>
        </a>

        <!-- Writing Tile -->
        <a href="/writing" class="grid-tile grid-tile-writing">
          <div class="tile-content">
            <span class="tile-title">WRITING</span>
          </div>
        </a>

        <!-- Contact Tile -->
        <a href="/about#contact" class="grid-tile grid-tile-contact">
          <div class="tile-content">
            <span class="tile-title">CONTACT ME!</span>
          </div>
        </a>

        <!-- About Tile -->
        <a href="/about" class="grid-tile grid-tile-about">
          <div class="tile-content">
            <span class="tile-title">ABOUT</span>
          </div>
        </a>

        <!-- News Tile -->
        <a href="#news" class="grid-tile grid-tile-news">
          <div class="tile-content">
            <span class="tile-title">NEWS</span>
          </div>
        </a>
      </div>

      <!-- Social Links -->
      <div class="social-links">
        <a href="https://bsky.app/profile/kettlebird.bsky.social" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="social-link">BLUESKY</a>
        <a href="https://kettle-bird.tumblr.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="social-link">TUMBLR</a>
        <a href="https://www.instagram.com/kettlebirdart" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="social-link">INSTAGRAM</a>
        <a href="https://ko-fi.com/kettlebirdart" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="social-link">KO-FI</a>
      </div>

      <!-- About the Artist Section -->
      <section class="about-section">
        <h2>ABOUT THE ARTIST</h2>
        <div class="portrait-placeholder">
          [Insert<br>Portrait Here]
        </div>
        <div class="about-text">
          <p>"Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit, sed do eiusmod tempor incididunt ut labore et dolore magna aliqua. Ut enim ad minim veniam, quis nostrud exercitation ullamco laboris nisi ut aliquip ex ea commodo consequat. Duis aute irure dolor in reprehenderit in voluptate velit esse cillum dolore eu fugiat nulla pariatur. Excepteur sint occaecat cupidatat non proident, sunt in culpa qui officia deserunt mollit anim id est laborum."</p>
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
